1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:02,070
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:03,440
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,210
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,880
(Episode 92)

5
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:10,780
This is just a simple interview
before the chairman election, right?

6
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,790
Yes. Since Park Tae Ho
wasn't arrested,

7
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:15,890
Hyun Jun was approved
as a candidate.

8
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:17,990
It seems they want
to run an evaluation...

9
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,260
before the board votes.

10
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:23,860
If the situation turns against you
during the chairman election,

11
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,560
what will you do?

12
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:29,070
Are you planning to leverage
Hyun Jun's secret?

13
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:37,280
Are you saying...

14
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:39,810
President Kim Dan Hui...

15
00:00:42,050 --> 00:00:43,050
knows too?

16
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,990
Well... It's just that...

17
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:51,660
If she reveals it
before the board meeting vote,

18
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,360
I'll definitely lose.

19
00:01:12,210 --> 00:01:14,450
If you have a plan
to deal with those two,

20
00:01:15,250 --> 00:01:16,550
I can help you.

21
00:01:19,180 --> 00:01:20,690
Just because
my slush fund was stolen,

22
00:01:20,690 --> 00:01:22,550
you think
I'm completely powerless now?

23
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:25,190
Do you think I'd ever resort...

24
00:01:26,990 --> 00:01:28,090
to getting help from you?

25
00:01:28,430 --> 00:01:31,930
I meant that I'd take
Manager Kang's place.

26
00:01:33,770 --> 00:01:36,030
Even Manager Kang betrayed me.

27
00:01:37,270 --> 00:01:39,070
Do you really think I'd keep...

28
00:01:39,070 --> 00:01:41,370
the daughter of Choi Sam Sik,
the man I killed, by my side?

29
00:01:41,670 --> 00:01:43,240
Just because
I approved the marriage,

30
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,480
don't go thinking
you're on my level now.

31
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,480
What is it?

32
00:01:48,850 --> 00:01:51,920
Are you worried I might seek revenge
like Baek Jin Ju?

33
00:01:53,050 --> 00:01:56,290
I abandoned my father
and chose you, sir.

34
00:01:56,490 --> 00:01:58,490
Why do you think I asked
to marry Hyun Jun?

35
00:01:58,990 --> 00:02:02,190
It was because I wanted to become
a true member of the Adele family.

36
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:06,000
Just tell me what I need to do.

37
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:11,870
You have to get back at them
for stealing the slush fund,

38
00:02:13,610 --> 00:02:15,270
but for Hyun Jun to become chairman,

39
00:02:15,670 --> 00:02:18,380
you can't just leave Kim Dan Hui
and Park Min Jun untouched.

40
00:02:19,710 --> 00:02:21,480
You've already thought
that far ahead, right?

41
00:02:31,390 --> 00:02:32,390
Do you...

42
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:35,290
still want to protect
Hyun Jun's secret?

43
00:02:35,990 --> 00:02:37,630
If his secret comes out,

44
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:41,330
I'm afraid Father might hurt
another person.

45
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:45,240
After what happened to CEO Choi,
we need to be careful.

46
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:49,570
You're right.
It never hurts to be careful.

47
00:02:50,310 --> 00:02:52,140
We have time
before the board meeting,

48
00:02:52,210 --> 00:02:53,650
so let's give it some more thought.

49
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,410
We'll also discuss it with Jin Ju.

50
00:02:59,550 --> 00:03:02,950
She'll want to protect his secret.

51
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:07,030
Well, good luck with your interview.

52
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:11,300
Okay.
I'll call you as soon as it's over.

53
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:12,960
Sure.

54
00:03:35,790 --> 00:03:38,020
What are you doing here?
You're not the chairman anymore.

55
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:42,490
The Adele Group...

56
00:03:43,390 --> 00:03:46,230
is my company, which I built
with my own two hands.

57
00:03:46,730 --> 00:03:48,000
Therefore, this position...

58
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:51,240
is only meant for someone
of my own blood.

59
00:03:53,100 --> 00:03:54,410
That's why I'm giving...

60
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:57,010
a brat like you one more chance.

61
00:03:57,380 --> 00:04:00,380
Betray my mother,
and you'll give me the Adele Group.

62
00:04:00,910 --> 00:04:01,980
Not this again.

63
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:03,850
Just be satisfied
with the slush fund you stole.

64
00:04:05,020 --> 00:04:07,450
I'm sure
that's enough compensation...

65
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:10,760
for the lives of Kim Myung Hui
and Baek Jun Gi.

66
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:15,260
If you insist on fighting
on Kim Dan Hui's side until the end,

67
00:04:17,030 --> 00:04:18,760
I can no longer...

68
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:22,370
think of you as my son.

69
00:04:23,330 --> 00:04:26,100
You actually still thought of me
as your son?

70
00:04:27,370 --> 00:04:28,640
Thirty years ago,

71
00:04:29,140 --> 00:04:32,340
from the moment
you strangled my mother,

72
00:04:33,210 --> 00:04:34,980
I stopped being your son.

73
00:04:36,410 --> 00:04:38,080
I'm content being the son
of two mothers,

74
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:40,750
the one who birthed me
and the one who protected me.

75
00:04:41,250 --> 00:04:45,090
I'll stand by my mother
and bring you down.

76
00:04:46,460 --> 00:04:47,460
Park Tae Ho,

77
00:04:47,930 --> 00:04:51,060
don't ever summon me
like this again.

78
00:05:21,730 --> 00:05:25,060
I'll have to make sure I remember
this time we spent together.

79
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:28,370
If I ever happen to lose my memory,

80
00:05:28,370 --> 00:05:29,770
I can look back on it.

81
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:33,170
Still,
I wish we had more time like this.

82
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,510
Time spent with you, Father.

83
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,280
Of course.

84
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:43,280
I never should've gotten attached
to trash like this.

85
00:05:55,730 --> 00:05:58,860
(Team Leader Choi Yu Na)

86
00:06:01,230 --> 00:06:05,140
It's me.
Prepare it exactly as I instructed.

87
00:06:12,410 --> 00:06:13,980
Because of this filthy thing,

88
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:15,850
Yu Na's Dad, and now Yu Na...

89
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:20,720
Money is the root of all evil.

90
00:06:21,490 --> 00:06:22,820
I need to get this out of my sight.

91
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:24,460
Mom!

92
00:06:25,690 --> 00:06:29,490
What is it? Are you here to look for
your father's phone again?

93
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:32,900
Where's the money? The money
the chairman gave you for Dad.

94
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,530
The money? It's gone.

95
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,740
I already threw it away.

96
00:06:40,270 --> 00:06:42,570
As if.
I bet it's around here somewhere.

97
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:45,180
You brat.

98
00:06:47,310 --> 00:06:48,310
You...

99
00:06:49,210 --> 00:06:52,280
This is the price they paid
for your father's life.

100
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,520
I'm still in so much pain...

101
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,750
that I can't even look
at this money.

102
00:06:57,220 --> 00:06:59,460
If you dare touch this money,

103
00:06:59,620 --> 00:07:01,260
I swear you'll pay dearly for it.

104
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:05,330
I'll pay? No, not having Adele
will destroy me.

105
00:07:05,730 --> 00:07:07,130
So give it to me!

106
00:07:07,570 --> 00:07:09,730
I need this to get
on the chairman's good side...

107
00:07:09,730 --> 00:07:12,040
and secure my place
in the Adele family.

108
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,470
You brat.

109
00:07:14,970 --> 00:07:15,970
Yu Na.

110
00:07:17,910 --> 00:07:18,910
Stop this now.

111
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:20,980
Just stop.

112
00:07:22,110 --> 00:07:24,020
You're all I have left now.

113
00:07:25,180 --> 00:07:27,420
I'm so scared
something will happen...

114
00:07:28,050 --> 00:07:29,390
to you too.

115
00:07:30,390 --> 00:07:32,060
It's all my fault.

116
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:35,190
The way I raised you,

117
00:07:35,890 --> 00:07:37,630
and the way your father died...

118
00:07:38,300 --> 00:07:39,860
It's because I failed as a parent.

119
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:44,900
I'll pay for everything instead,

120
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:49,370
so please just stop this.
Yu Na, please.

121
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,780
- Please.
- I've come too far...

122
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:55,750
to stop now.

123
00:07:58,850 --> 00:08:02,020
Yu Na!

124
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,090
What am I going to do with her?

125
00:08:06,890 --> 00:08:09,330
How can I possibly stop her?

126
00:08:12,530 --> 00:08:14,270
That's it. Jin Ju.

127
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,600
I'll have to ask Jin Ju for help.

128
00:08:26,540 --> 00:08:28,480
Choi Yu Na took the bag of money?

129
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,750
Why all of a sudden?

130
00:08:32,250 --> 00:08:34,250
Did she mention
what she needed the money for?

131
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:36,390
She said she'd show it
to Chairman Park...

132
00:08:36,790 --> 00:08:38,490
and become part of the Adele family.

133
00:08:38,790 --> 00:08:40,420
That's all she told me.

134
00:08:42,060 --> 00:08:44,630
Okay, got it. I'll look into it.

135
00:08:47,370 --> 00:08:49,430
It seems Choi Yu Na
is up to something again.

136
00:08:49,770 --> 00:08:51,700
I think it has something
to do with Park Tae Ho.

137
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:53,540
He's not the type
to just sit back...

138
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,070
after having
his slush fund taken away.

139
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:58,410
So far, there's nothing significant
in the intel team's report.

140
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:01,750
With Manager Kang gone and
Detective Yun out of the picture,

141
00:09:02,010 --> 00:09:03,950
his hands are tied
even if he wants to act.

142
00:09:04,250 --> 00:09:07,550
So he might be using Choi Yu Na.
Please have her watched.

143
00:09:07,850 --> 00:09:08,850
Got it.

144
00:09:09,190 --> 00:09:11,290
I'll have them watch Choi Yu Na
and Park Hyun Jun as well.

145
00:09:11,990 --> 00:09:13,120
Hyun Jun too?

146
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:16,430
They're interviewing
the chairman candidates for Adele.

147
00:09:16,730 --> 00:09:18,560
The board will meet soon
to appoint a new chairman,

148
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:19,660
so we have to keep an eye on him.

149
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:21,070
Right.

150
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:31,880
You just focus
on acing your interview.

151
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:36,750
I've already threatened Kim Dan Hui
and made a deal with her.

152
00:09:36,980 --> 00:09:38,080
A threat?

153
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:41,490
The alleged affair between
Min Jun and Jin Ju is useless now.

154
00:09:41,490 --> 00:09:42,550
And a deal?

155
00:09:43,150 --> 00:09:44,860
It'll be hard to get
the slush fund ledger...

156
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:46,520
before the board meeting.

157
00:09:48,930 --> 00:09:52,460
CEO Choi Sam Sik's audio file
will also be an issue.

158
00:09:53,230 --> 00:09:55,730
Then what are we supposed to do?

159
00:09:55,730 --> 00:09:56,870
Moon Tae Jin.

160
00:09:58,400 --> 00:10:00,810
- Find Moon Tae Jin.
- What?

161
00:10:01,170 --> 00:10:04,210
The major shareholder
who's been impossible to find?

162
00:10:04,410 --> 00:10:07,880
To become chairman and prove
my worth no matter whose son I am,

163
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:11,750
even if Father gets arrested
or my secret is exposed,

164
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:15,290
I need Moon Tae Jin
to acknowledge me.

165
00:10:15,850 --> 00:10:19,190
- But he's on Kim Dan Hui's side.
- Exactly.

166
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:22,660
That's why I have to meet him
and change his mind somehow.

167
00:10:30,470 --> 00:10:32,200
Before the board meeting,

168
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:35,410
we have to find him, no matter what.

169
00:10:45,550 --> 00:10:47,490
(Bit Life President, Oh Jung Ran)

170
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:52,920
Does being the president
of the bio division suit you?

171
00:10:53,190 --> 00:10:54,190
You.

172
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:57,130
What are you going to do
about Hyun Jun's secret?

173
00:10:58,130 --> 00:10:59,660
Will you reveal it
at the board meeting...

174
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:00,770
and become chairman?

175
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:05,100
Since you haven't updated me
on finding the slush fund ledger,

176
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:08,310
there's no reason for me
to keep his secret.

177
00:11:08,310 --> 00:11:09,410
Why you...

178
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,380
The chairman position...

179
00:11:15,210 --> 00:11:16,380
Give it up.

180
00:11:16,380 --> 00:11:17,750
If Hyun Jun becomes chairman,

181
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:19,950
I'll find Park Tae Ho's
slush fund ledger somehow...

182
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:21,120
and give it to you.

183
00:11:21,190 --> 00:11:22,190
Then,

184
00:11:22,690 --> 00:11:24,620
tell Hyun Jun to step down first.

185
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,760
Bring me the slush fund ledger,

186
00:11:26,820 --> 00:11:30,030
and I'll step aside once Park Tae Ho
is brought to justice.

187
00:11:30,090 --> 00:11:31,760
How can I trust you?

188
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:33,660
I could ask you the same thing.

189
00:11:41,310 --> 00:11:42,310
Fine.

190
00:11:42,970 --> 00:11:44,440
Go ahead and do whatever you want.

191
00:11:44,510 --> 00:11:47,610
Think it over
before the board meeting.

192
00:11:56,350 --> 00:11:57,350
Right.

193
00:11:58,060 --> 00:12:00,760
Hyun Jun was right.
That's the only way.

194
00:12:06,230 --> 00:12:07,230
Get me information...

195
00:12:07,300 --> 00:12:09,030
on the major shareholder,
Moon Tae Jin.

196
00:12:09,670 --> 00:12:11,670
Dig up every record on him
you can find,

197
00:12:11,740 --> 00:12:13,840
starting from when
he became a shareholder.

198
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,080
Goodness.

199
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:24,880
Oh my.

200
00:12:25,380 --> 00:12:26,820
What's all this?

201
00:12:27,050 --> 00:12:29,720
Oh, these are
old shareholder records.

202
00:12:29,990 --> 00:12:32,560
Why do you suddenly need
the old shareholder records?

203
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,890
Well, that's...

204
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:39,360
Don't ask any more questions.
I can't...

205
00:12:39,830 --> 00:12:41,570
trust you anymore, Mrs. Ok.

206
00:12:42,330 --> 00:12:45,170
Hey, are those the documents
on Moon Tae Jin?

207
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:48,740
Seriously? You shouldn't be talking
about such sensitive information...

208
00:12:49,670 --> 00:12:51,540
out in the open.

209
00:12:51,710 --> 00:12:53,580
Look, we're short on time.

210
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:56,480
Find addresses and contact numbers
you can for Moon Tae Jin.

211
00:12:56,610 --> 00:12:58,350
We need a clue to where he's hiding,

212
00:12:58,420 --> 00:13:00,550
even if we have to search
the entire country.

213
00:13:00,850 --> 00:13:02,650
Mom, look through these first.

214
00:13:02,650 --> 00:13:05,490
I'll go meet
Moon Tae Jin's proxy lawyers ...

215
00:13:05,490 --> 00:13:06,990
- and see what I find out.
- Okay.

216
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:11,030
If they won't cooperate,
threaten them. Got it?

217
00:13:11,530 --> 00:13:12,560
I'm off.

218
00:13:13,730 --> 00:13:14,730
Hurry.

219
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:29,450
Hyun Jun is looking
for Moon Tae Jin?

220
00:13:29,510 --> 00:13:33,450
That's right. I've had
the intel team tracking his moves,

221
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:35,650
and it looks like both
he and Oh Jung Ran...

222
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,450
are scrambling to find Moon Tae Jin.

223
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:40,820
He's probably trying
to persuade Moon Tae Jin...

224
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:43,260
in case he gets disqualified
as a candidate...

225
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:45,030
if Father gets arrested again
or investigated.

226
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:47,800
Even if Hyun Jun's secret
is revealed at the board meeting,

227
00:13:47,970 --> 00:13:51,570
his plan is to push through with
the major shareholder's support.

228
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:54,070
Shouldn't we do something?

229
00:13:54,870 --> 00:13:57,510
No matter how supportive
Moon Tae Jin is of Dan Hui,

230
00:13:57,580 --> 00:13:59,040
they've never actually met
face-to-face.

231
00:13:59,040 --> 00:14:01,310
He could change his mind
at any time.

232
00:14:02,810 --> 00:14:05,780
I should go to Ihwachae
and meet Mrs. Han.

233
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,160
Hold on.

234
00:14:12,760 --> 00:14:14,090
What's all this?

235
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:15,860
I'll explain later.

236
00:14:15,860 --> 00:14:18,060
I'm busy making sure
our Hyun Jun becomes chairman.

237
00:14:18,130 --> 00:14:20,660
- What?
- I said I'm busy. Come on.

238
00:14:21,530 --> 00:14:22,530
What the...

239
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:29,710
Where are they going at this hour?

240
00:14:29,770 --> 00:14:31,110
Since Moon Tae Jin,

241
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:33,580
the major shareholder,
is backing Kim Dan Hui,

242
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:36,680
Ms. Oh's going to meet him
to try and change his mind.

243
00:14:36,910 --> 00:14:41,790
What? I'm backing Park Hyun Jun,
so why do they need his support?

244
00:14:41,990 --> 00:14:45,560
She said she's worried
because the directors are wavering.

245
00:14:47,460 --> 00:14:48,460
Unbelievable.

246
00:14:48,530 --> 00:14:52,330
It really is frustrating not having
an assistant reporting to me.

247
00:14:58,740 --> 00:15:00,240
President Kim Dan Hui...

248
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:02,570
has the support
of the major shareholder?

249
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:06,210
I might be able to use this.

250
00:15:09,580 --> 00:15:10,710
Hello, Mrs. Han.

251
00:15:11,450 --> 00:15:13,220
I'm sorry to call you so late.

252
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:16,620
I'm calling because I urgently need
to see you about Moon Tae Jin.

253
00:15:17,660 --> 00:15:18,660
What?

254
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:22,330
Moon Tae Jin sent word?

255
00:15:22,530 --> 00:15:23,530
That's right.

256
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:29,000
He says he feels burdened
by both sides seeking him out.

257
00:15:30,430 --> 00:15:33,270
He said he'll attend
the board meeting in person,

258
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:35,810
and that he wants to meet then.

259
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:37,370
Right.

260
00:15:37,780 --> 00:15:41,110
I understand.
Thank you for letting me know.

261
00:15:44,650 --> 00:15:47,420
He's attending the board meeting
in person?

262
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:59,460
Were you out looking all night?

263
00:15:59,530 --> 00:16:03,030
I checked all the addresses
on the shareholder list,

264
00:16:03,770 --> 00:16:06,440
- but I couldn't find a single clue.
- What about you?

265
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:08,570
Did you find out anything
through the lawyers?

266
00:16:10,270 --> 00:16:12,280
They all dodged me,
saying they can't disclose...

267
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,480
client information.

268
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:16,650
Moon Tae Jin, that man.

269
00:16:17,010 --> 00:16:19,580
How did he manage
to keep everyone so quiet?

270
00:16:20,850 --> 00:16:23,790
The board meeting is today.
What are we going to do?

271
00:16:24,150 --> 00:16:25,160
It's fine.

272
00:16:26,290 --> 00:16:27,730
Now that it's come to this,

273
00:16:28,790 --> 00:16:30,430
we have no choice
but to face it head-on.

274
00:16:38,070 --> 00:16:40,800
So today's the day you'll finally
be appointed chairman.

275
00:16:41,310 --> 00:16:43,170
I heard the major shareholder,
Moon Tae Jin,

276
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,440
said he'll be attending too.

277
00:16:45,210 --> 00:16:47,850
Don't you think
he's coming to support you?

278
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,920
(This is Moon Tae Jin. Let's meet
in Park Min Jun's office.)

279
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:57,420
It's from Moon Tae Jin.

280
00:16:57,420 --> 00:16:59,420
He wants to meet
before the board meeting.

281
00:17:10,870 --> 00:17:12,170
(Head of Division 1, Park Min Jun)

282
00:17:13,140 --> 00:17:15,610
It looks like he hasn't arrived yet.

283
00:17:32,290 --> 00:17:33,490
Park Tae Ho.

284
00:17:34,660 --> 00:17:35,830
What did I tell you?

285
00:17:36,630 --> 00:17:39,330
I told you the Moon Tae Jin card
would work.

286
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:42,330
You covered our tracks, right?

287
00:17:42,770 --> 00:17:46,500
Of course. I had the CCTV footage
altered to match our movements,

288
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:48,510
and we used a hallway
that staff doesn't use,

289
00:17:48,510 --> 00:17:50,040
so there are no witnesses.

290
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:52,110
Even if they report it
to the police,

291
00:17:52,410 --> 00:17:55,350
there's no evidence
other than their claims.

292
00:17:55,350 --> 00:17:56,450
Choi Yu Na.

293
00:17:56,510 --> 00:17:58,020
What do you think you're doing?

294
00:17:59,150 --> 00:18:00,550
I set a trap.

295
00:18:02,050 --> 00:18:03,690
Kim Dan Hui,

296
00:18:04,250 --> 00:18:07,220
I can't just hand this position over
to you.

297
00:18:11,230 --> 00:18:12,530
Get away from my mother.

298
00:18:12,560 --> 00:18:14,700
If you so much
as lay a finger on her...

299
00:18:14,770 --> 00:18:15,870
Unbelievable.

300
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:21,000
Min Jun. No, let go!

301
00:18:22,110 --> 00:18:23,440
You insolent punk.

302
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:25,640
Today, you'll learn...

303
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:27,680
what a blessing it was to live...

304
00:18:28,010 --> 00:18:30,780
as Park Tae Ho's son!

305
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:33,580
Min Jun!

306
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:38,420
What are you doing?

307
00:18:42,130 --> 00:18:44,460
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

308
00:18:52,570 --> 00:18:54,710
(Candidate Kim Dan Hui,
Candidate Park Hyun Jun)

309
00:18:54,770 --> 00:18:56,440
(Head of Division 1, Park Min Jun)

310
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,510
Right.

311
00:19:01,280 --> 00:19:05,750
Today, we'll hold a vote
to select our next chairman.

312
00:19:05,820 --> 00:19:07,380
To guarantee a fair process,

313
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:10,790
we've brought in Ms. Baek Jin Ju
from JKL Partners...

314
00:19:11,090 --> 00:19:13,220
and CEO James
as independent observers.

315
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:22,430
Following the vote,
our major shareholder, Moon Tae Jin,

316
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,130
will represent
the other shareholders...

317
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:26,200
in greeting the new chairman.

318
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:27,500
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

319
00:19:27,540 --> 00:19:29,040
The major shareholder Moon Tae Jin?

320
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:35,580
The major shareholder is attending
in person?

321
00:19:35,650 --> 00:19:39,050
Moon Tae Jin, who we couldn't find
all night, is coming here?

322
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:40,620
Moon Tae Jin...

323
00:19:42,390 --> 00:19:44,320
What kind of person is he?

324
00:19:45,220 --> 00:19:46,320
By the way,

325
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:49,560
have former President Kim Dan Hui...

326
00:19:50,130 --> 00:19:53,060
and Director Park Min Jun
not arrived yet?

327
00:19:55,370 --> 00:19:58,270
There are still ten minutes left.
Let's wait a bit.

328
00:19:59,900 --> 00:20:00,900
Are they stuck in traffic?

329
00:20:01,610 --> 00:20:03,970
- Why aren't they here yet?
- I'll try contacting them.

330
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:16,120
It's Baek Jin Ju.

331
00:20:16,650 --> 00:20:19,790
The board meeting is about to start,
so she must be getting anxious.

332
00:20:25,930 --> 00:20:28,800
Here, answer the phone.

333
00:20:28,870 --> 00:20:31,370
Tell them you're withdrawing
your candidacy...

334
00:20:31,870 --> 00:20:33,800
- for chairman.
- What?

335
00:20:34,670 --> 00:20:35,670
Withdraw my candidacy?

336
00:20:37,370 --> 00:20:38,480
Mother, no.

337
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:42,610
You should do
as the chairman instructs.

338
00:20:42,750 --> 00:20:46,580
It's the only way
you'll get out of here safely.

339
00:20:48,090 --> 00:20:49,090
No.

340
00:20:50,620 --> 00:20:54,990
If I don't show up,
Jin Ju will find a way.

341
00:20:55,490 --> 00:20:57,690
Even if I die here,

342
00:20:58,100 --> 00:21:01,430
I won't let you have your way,
Park Tae Ho.

343
00:21:03,370 --> 00:21:04,370
Of course.

344
00:21:04,970 --> 00:21:09,040
Kim Dan Hui, you're not afraid
of dying, are you?

345
00:21:09,570 --> 00:21:13,240
That's why I came up
with the perfect solution for you.

346
00:21:14,140 --> 00:21:15,710
The perfect solution?

347
00:21:17,210 --> 00:21:18,220
Begin.

348
00:21:21,650 --> 00:21:24,960
Min Jun, no! Let go of me!

349
00:21:25,190 --> 00:21:29,960
Min Jun! No, just stop it. Stop!

350
00:21:32,300 --> 00:21:34,530
The person you have called
is unavailable.

351
00:21:36,500 --> 00:21:38,740
What's wrong? Can't get through?

352
00:21:38,740 --> 00:21:40,970
Something feels off.

353
00:21:41,770 --> 00:21:43,470
I think something went wrong.

354
00:21:43,570 --> 00:21:46,340
Can you get the intel team on this
and track them down?

355
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,880
Okay, I'm on it.

356
00:21:48,780 --> 00:21:51,210
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

357
00:21:56,020 --> 00:21:58,490
If it looks like Park Hyun Jun
will become chairman,

358
00:21:58,560 --> 00:21:59,560
you have to stop him,

359
00:22:00,320 --> 00:22:02,230
even if that means
exposing his secret.

360
00:22:03,190 --> 00:22:04,190
Got it?

361
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:17,840
What's going on?

362
00:22:18,210 --> 00:22:20,840
Did something really happen
to Kim Dan Hui?

363
00:22:50,570 --> 00:22:52,010
I am withdrawing my candidacy...

364
00:22:52,180 --> 00:22:55,410
No. Mother, don't.

365
00:22:58,780 --> 00:23:00,380
for chairman.

366
00:23:00,850 --> 00:23:02,090
Mother!

367
00:23:24,140 --> 00:23:26,810
Min Jun!

368
00:23:40,020 --> 00:23:41,320
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

369
00:23:41,360 --> 00:23:42,360
Well...

370
00:23:44,360 --> 00:23:47,700
Former President Kim Dan Hui,
a candidate for chairman,

371
00:23:49,570 --> 00:23:51,200
has withdrawn her candidacy.

372
00:23:58,280 --> 00:24:01,610
She withdrew her candidacy?
Something must've gone wrong.

373
00:24:01,810 --> 00:24:05,180
Please give us a moment
to look into the situation.

374
00:24:05,850 --> 00:24:07,680
That's your problem, not ours.

375
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:09,950
Since she withdrew,
Hyun Jun's the only candidate left,

376
00:24:10,020 --> 00:24:12,420
so it comes down
to a yes or no vote.

377
00:24:13,120 --> 00:24:15,690
- That's right.
- Yes, she's right.

378
00:24:16,430 --> 00:24:18,260
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

379
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:27,400
If it looks like Park Hyun Jun
will become chairman,

380
00:24:27,470 --> 00:24:28,510
you have to stop him,

381
00:24:29,870 --> 00:24:31,780
even if that means
exposing his secret.

382
00:24:32,310 --> 00:24:33,310
Got it?

383
00:24:36,310 --> 00:24:39,280
Park Tae Ho, how could you?

384
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:43,550
How could you do this
to your own son...

385
00:24:43,990 --> 00:24:46,320
just to take control
of the chairman seat?

386
00:24:46,990 --> 00:24:49,630
Who says my son is even
in this room?

387
00:24:50,830 --> 00:24:52,760
That punk, Park Min Jun,

388
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:55,970
is the one who walked away
from being my son.

389
00:24:58,170 --> 00:24:59,770
Now, shall we go
to the board meeting...

390
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:01,910
and see the results?

391
00:25:08,610 --> 00:25:10,950
Min Jun, are you okay?

392
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:14,120
I'm okay. I'm fine.

393
00:25:14,950 --> 00:25:16,290
How could he?

394
00:25:17,490 --> 00:25:18,560
I'm okay.

395
00:25:23,430 --> 00:25:25,100
(Candidate Park Hyun Jun)

396
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:27,530
Did you have a hand
in this situation?

397
00:25:27,860 --> 00:25:28,870
No.

398
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:33,100
Could Park Tae Ho have planned
something behind our backs?

399
00:25:35,470 --> 00:25:37,740
Either way, this is an opportunity.

400
00:25:37,740 --> 00:25:39,610
We'll figure out
what happened later.

401
00:25:39,910 --> 00:25:42,180
Right now,
just secure the chairman seat.

402
00:25:47,380 --> 00:25:51,290
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

403
00:25:52,820 --> 00:25:55,130
Does anyone have any objections
to me becoming the chairman?

404
00:25:58,930 --> 00:26:00,060
Anyone?

405
00:26:03,330 --> 00:26:05,270
What are we supposed to do?

406
00:26:06,470 --> 00:26:10,470
- What do we do?
- Then we should hold a vote...

407
00:26:12,280 --> 00:26:13,310
I...

408
00:26:14,410 --> 00:26:15,410
object.

409
00:26:23,950 --> 00:26:26,390
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

410
00:26:29,930 --> 00:26:33,430
Baek Jin Ju,
are you going to expose me?

411
00:26:35,970 --> 00:26:38,500
On behalf
of former President Kim Dan Hui,

412
00:26:39,200 --> 00:26:42,640
I'm running for the chairmanship.

413
00:26:42,910 --> 00:26:46,140
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

414
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:48,180
She'll run for chairman?

415
00:26:58,390 --> 00:27:00,720
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

416
00:27:09,930 --> 00:27:13,170
So the phone trace leads
right to the chairman's office?

417
00:27:13,300 --> 00:27:14,300
Got it.

418
00:27:14,670 --> 00:27:15,670
James!

419
00:27:15,940 --> 00:27:17,070
Yoon Jung.

420
00:27:17,310 --> 00:27:19,040
You mean Dan Hui is here right now?

421
00:27:19,040 --> 00:27:22,680
Yes, the intel team says
this is the most likely location.

422
00:27:23,950 --> 00:27:24,950
Dan Hui.

423
00:27:25,320 --> 00:27:29,790
Dan Hui!

424
00:27:30,550 --> 00:27:31,550
Yoon Jung.

425
00:27:33,060 --> 00:27:35,430
- Mr. Park!
- Yoon Jung!

426
00:27:35,430 --> 00:27:37,960
- Is that you, Dan Hui?
- Yoon Jung, I'm in here.

427
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:40,060
- Wait, hang on.
- Yoon Jung!

428
00:27:43,670 --> 00:27:46,840
You're running for chairman
instead of Kim Dan Hui?

429
00:27:46,940 --> 00:27:49,140
Baek Jin Ju,
what gives you the right?

430
00:27:49,470 --> 00:27:53,440
You aren't even with Adele Group,
nor are you a director.

431
00:27:53,440 --> 00:27:56,950
Then let's add an emergency item
to the agenda...

432
00:27:57,110 --> 00:27:59,380
and discuss the appointment
of a new director.

433
00:28:00,550 --> 00:28:03,350
We can hold a vote
after the discussion, can't we?

434
00:28:06,490 --> 00:28:09,890
It's a ridiculous demand,
but I have to buy time somehow...

435
00:28:10,460 --> 00:28:13,700
until James and the intel team
can find something.

436
00:28:14,930 --> 00:28:16,130
Baek Jin Ju,

437
00:28:16,230 --> 00:28:18,670
you're just making trouble
to buy time, aren't you?

438
00:28:18,870 --> 00:28:21,370
But it's pointless.

439
00:28:21,700 --> 00:28:24,870
Kim Dan Hui and Park Min Jun
will never make it here.

440
00:28:25,280 --> 00:28:28,040
You. You and Park Tae Ho.

441
00:28:28,310 --> 00:28:30,250
What have you done?

442
00:28:31,380 --> 00:28:32,450
Enough.

443
00:28:33,350 --> 00:28:36,420
This is ridiculous. Ignore her
and let's proceed with the vote.

444
00:28:36,490 --> 00:28:39,690
All those in favor
of Hyun Jun's appointment,

445
00:28:39,690 --> 00:28:41,020
raise your hands now.

446
00:28:46,130 --> 00:28:47,260
Raise your hands.

447
00:28:47,630 --> 00:28:49,700
It's not completely out of line.

448
00:28:50,070 --> 00:28:51,370
What?

449
00:28:51,570 --> 00:28:54,370
There's an exception
in Article 35 of the bylaws.

450
00:28:55,310 --> 00:28:57,310
If nominated by a shareholder...

451
00:28:57,310 --> 00:29:00,280
holding over five percent
of the total shares,

452
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:02,110
even a non-director...

453
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:04,510
is eligible for chairman.

454
00:29:07,220 --> 00:29:08,920
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

455
00:29:08,990 --> 00:29:12,090
Hey. What? Five percent?

456
00:29:12,320 --> 00:29:13,890
Besides me,

457
00:29:14,260 --> 00:29:17,530
no one here holds that many shares!

458
00:29:19,260 --> 00:29:20,700
I do.

459
00:29:25,170 --> 00:29:26,170
What?

460
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:30,240
What...

461
00:29:30,570 --> 00:29:32,280
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

462
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:36,550
Wait. Hold on. Butler Ok?

463
00:29:36,910 --> 00:29:37,910
Butler Ok?

464
00:29:39,080 --> 00:29:41,480
Wait, why is Butler Ok here?

465
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:47,360
What do you think you're doing here?

466
00:29:48,490 --> 00:29:50,530
Allow me
to formally introduce myself.

467
00:29:50,560 --> 00:29:54,330
I'm the owner of 5.5 percent
of Adele Group's shares,

468
00:29:54,830 --> 00:29:57,630
major shareholder Moon Tae Jin.

469
00:29:58,470 --> 00:30:00,570
- What?
- Her?

470
00:30:03,070 --> 00:30:04,840
- She's Moon Tae Jin?
- Moon Tae Jin?

471
00:30:05,240 --> 00:30:06,240
What?

472
00:30:06,980 --> 00:30:09,210
Butler Ok is the major shareholder?

473
00:30:10,380 --> 00:30:13,080
Wait. How can you be Moon Tae Jin?

474
00:30:13,650 --> 00:30:17,120
After all the crazy things I did
to find Moon Tae Jin...

475
00:30:18,490 --> 00:30:20,920
You're telling me you were right
under my nose the whole time?

476
00:30:21,260 --> 00:30:25,130
Yes, and watching you
has been pretty entertaining.

477
00:30:26,330 --> 00:30:28,670
Who in the world are you?

478
00:30:29,370 --> 00:30:31,770
What was your motive
for sneaking into my home?

479
00:30:33,000 --> 00:30:34,100
Before we get to that,

480
00:30:34,700 --> 00:30:36,610
let's settle the matter
of appointing the chairman first.

481
00:30:38,440 --> 00:30:42,250
If former President Kim Dan Hui
withdrew her candidacy for chairman,

482
00:30:42,710 --> 00:30:44,780
I'll exercise my right
as a major shareholder...

483
00:30:45,350 --> 00:30:46,850
under the bylaws'
exception clause...

484
00:30:48,380 --> 00:30:52,520
to nominate Ms. Baek Jin Ju
as a candidate for chairman.

485
00:30:52,820 --> 00:30:54,860
Wait, what?

486
00:30:59,560 --> 00:31:00,560
This is ridiculous.

487
00:31:02,330 --> 00:31:03,570
The major shareholder
is nominating her?

488
00:31:05,740 --> 00:31:08,710
A chairman candidate?
Absolutely not!

489
00:31:09,010 --> 00:31:10,210
Ms. Baek Jin Ju.

490
00:31:10,840 --> 00:31:12,240
Are you ready to run for chairman...

491
00:31:12,680 --> 00:31:16,710
and compete
against Director Park Hyun Jun?

492
00:31:29,530 --> 00:31:30,530
Yes.

493
00:31:32,860 --> 00:31:35,800
I'll compete for the chairmanship
as a candidate.

494
00:31:36,370 --> 00:31:37,530
Baek Jin Ju...

495
00:31:49,550 --> 00:31:51,680
(Regular Board Meeting
- Next Chairman Selection)

496
00:32:13,800 --> 00:32:16,770
(Pearl in Red)

497
00:32:16,770 --> 00:32:19,740
From now on,
we'll be your pillar of support.

498
00:32:20,080 --> 00:32:23,850
I'll take down Park Tae Ho
and bring justice for his victims.

499
00:32:23,980 --> 00:32:25,480
Do you think my life
can return to normal...

500
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:27,180
if I give up the chairmanship?

501
00:32:27,180 --> 00:32:29,550
I'm completely backed
into a corner, too.

502
00:32:29,990 --> 00:32:32,920
Even if it's you, and regardless
of how much I loved you,

503
00:32:32,990 --> 00:32:35,220
I'm the kind of man
who puts saving his own skin first.

504
00:32:35,990 --> 00:32:38,060
- Sir...
- Yu Na!

505
00:32:38,060 --> 00:32:40,060
Come back with the shares.

506
00:32:40,460 --> 00:32:42,200
- If you fail,
- Oh, dear.

507
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:44,300
don't you dare set foot
in my house again.

508
00:32:45,340 --> 00:32:47,340
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
